### useTimeout

 A hook for creating and managing timeouts.

```typescript
useTimeout(
  callback: () => void,
  delay: number | null
);
```

**Examples**:

```tsx
// Auto-hide message
const showMessage = () => {
  setMessage('Hello!');
  useTimeout(() => {
    setMessage(null);
  }, 3000);
};

// Debounced search
const [searchTerm, setSearchTerm] = useState('');
useTimeout(() => {
