  setLoading(true);
  useTimeout(() => {
    navigate('/login');
  }, 1000);
};
```

**Common Use Cases**:
- Auto-dismissing notifications
- Debounced actions
- Idle detection
- Delayed navigation
- Loading states

**Performance Considerations**:
- Clear timeouts on unmount
- Use proper cleanup in effects

