## Prompt Usage Guide

**Combination Formula**: `[Style Prompt DNA] + [Scenario Template (see scene-templates.md)] + [Specific Content]`

### Core Principle: Describe Mood Not Layout

Key to AI image generation: Short prompts > Long prompts. Describing 3 sentences of mood and content works better than 30 lines of layout details.

| Diversity-Killing Approach | Creativity-Inspiring Approach |
|----------------|----------------|
| Specify color ratios (60%/25%/15%) | Describe mood ("warm like Sunday morning") |
| Dictate layout positions ("title centered, image on right") | Reference specific aesthetics ("Pentagram editorial feel") |
| Constrain character poses and expressions | Let AI naturally interpret the style |
| List all visual elements to include | Describe what audience should feel |

### Good / Bad Examples

**Bad — Over-constrained (AI generates empty and flat output):**
```
Professional presentation slide. Dark background, light text.
Title centered at top. Two columns below. Left column: bullet points.
Right column: bar chart. Colors: navy 60%, white 30%, gold 10%.
Font size: title 36pt, body 18pt. Margins: 40px all sides.
```

**Good — Mood-driven (Generates diverse and textured output):**
```
A data visualization that feels like a Bloomberg Businessweek
editorial spread. The key number "28.5%" should dominate the
composition like a headline. Warm cream tones with sharp black
typography. The data tells a story of dramatic channel shift.
```

### Execution Path Selection

Choose according to the "Best Path" column in the quick reference:
- **AI Generation**: Styles with clear visual elements (06/07/12/13/14/15/16/20), use Gemini/Midjourney for direct output
- **HTML Rendering**: Styles relying on precise typography (01/03/04/10/11/17/18), code controls data and layout
- **Hybrid**: HTML for skeleton layout + AI generation for illustrations/backgrounds (02/05/08/09/19)

### Quality Control

1. ❌ Don't write "in the style of Pentagram" directly → ✅ Use specific design characteristic descriptions
2. Text often errors in AI generation → Replace text after generation
3. Proportions easily distorted → Explicitly specify aspect ratio
4. Generate 3-5 variants first, then refine the best one

**Default Aesthetic No-Go Zones** (users can override per their brand):
- ❌ Cyber neon/dark blue backgrounds (#0D1117)
- ❌ Personal signatures/watermarks on cover images

