## 1. WeChat Official Account Cover / Article Featured Image

**Specifications**:
- Cover image: 2.35:1 (900×383px or 1200×510px)
- Article illustration: 16:9 (1200×675px) or 4:3 (1200×900px)

**Key Design Elements**:
- Visual impact priority (users quickly scan through information feeds)
- Minimal or no text (WeChat official account title will overlay on top)
- Moderate color saturation (WeChat reading environment is white-leaning)
- Avoid excessive detail (must be recognizable as thumbnail)

**Recommended Styles**: 01 Pentagram / 11 Build / 12 Sagmeister / 18 Kenya Hara / 07 Field.io

**Scene Prompt Template**:
```
[Style DNA insert here]
- Article cover image for WeChat subscription
- Landscape format, 2.35:1 aspect ratio
- Bold visual impact, minimal or no text
- Moderate color saturation for white reading environment
- Must remain recognizable as thumbnail
- Clean composition with clear focal point
```

---

## 2. Article Illustration / Concept Visualization

**Specifications**:
- 16:9 (1200×675px) most versatile
- 1:1 (800×800px) suitable for emphasis
- 4:3 (1200×900px) suitable for information-dense content

**Key Design Elements**:
- Serve article arguments, not decoration
- Create visual rhythm with context
- Concisely express one core concept
- AI generation preferred, HTML screenshots only for precise data tables

**Recommended Styles**: Choose based on article tone, commonly 01/04/10/17/18

**Scene Prompt Template**:
```
[Style DNA insert here]
