# SFX Library · huashu-design

> All generated by ElevenLabs Sound Generation API, Apple keynote-level audio quality.
> Production-grade SFX asset library, covering all scenarios for huashu animation/demos/product demos.

**Asset Location**: `assets/sfx/<category>/<name>.mp3`
**Total**: 37 SFX (30 batch generated + 7 v7b reserved)
**Generation Model**: ElevenLabs Sound Generation API (prompt_influence 0.4)
**Audio Quality**: 44.1kHz MP3, Apple keynote-level clarity, no additional reverb

---

