## 🎨 Auxiliary Assets

### Color palette
- Primary: #XXXXXX  <source annotation>
- Background: #XXXXXX
- Ink: #XXXXXX
- Accent: #XXXXXX
- Disabled colors: <colors brand explicitly doesn't use>

### Typography
- Display: <font stack>
- Body: <font stack>
- Mono (for data HUD): <font stack>

### Signature details
