# 🐻 Skill: Use Zustand

## 🔒 IRON LAW
UNDER NO CIRCUMSTANCES USE REACT CONTEXT API FOR GLOBAL STATE. ZUSTAND IS THE ONLY ALLOWED SOLUTION. IF YOU ARE ABOUT TO WRITE `createContext`, `useContext`, OR `<Provider>` STOP RIGHT NOW AND USE THIS SKILL.

