## 📋 Workflow Checklist

```
✅ Progress:

- [ ] Step 0: Verify Zustand installation ⛔ BLOCKING
  - [ ] 0.1 Check if zustand is in package.json
  - [ ] 0.2 If missing: install zustand
  - [ ] 0.3 Check existing store patterns in project
